```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Gateway as MCP Gateway
    participant Router as Intent Router
    participant Orch as Master Orchestrator
    participant Tool as MCP Tool
    participant Gov as Governance Engine
    
    Client->>Gateway: JSON-RPC Request
    activate Gateway
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validate Protocol
    Gateway->>Router: Route Intent
    activate Router
    Router->>Router: Classify Intent
    Router->>Orch: Dispatch to Orchestrator
    deactivate Router
    activate Orch
    Orch->>Gov: Check Governance
    activate Gov
    Gov-->>Orch: ✅ Approved
    deactivate Gov
    Orch->>Tool: Execute Tool
    activate Tool
    Tool->>Tool: Perform Action
    Tool-->>Orch: Result
    deactivate Tool
    Orch-->>Gateway: Response
    deactivate Orch
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON-RPC Response
    deactivate Gateway
    
    Note over Client,Gov: Typical latency: 50-150ms
```
